meta {
  name: 01_DraftRequest
  seq: 1
}

docs {
  Scenario: The requester opens the draft a service owner prepared

    Given the service owner has created a draft package request for the requester
    When the requester opens the draft
    Then the draft shows the package, the parties and the service owner
    And an outsider cannot open the draft
    When the service owner withdraws the draft
    Then the withdrawn request can no longer be opened as a draft
}
